From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pokeplatinum-3ds <noreply@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 20:05:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Route 203's south-east corner goes on south (SDK_PORT_3DS)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Past Route 203's south-east corner (x 248-255) its dirt and the plateau's
cliff reached the south edge above the forest's filler, black between
them, seen from the route and from Oreburgh City's west side. They are
drawn on south (sPortExtrudeColumns) and the forest's first rows there
left out (sPortMapCuts): its edge goes on straight from the route's.
---
diff --git a/src/overlay005/land_data.c b/src/overlay005/land_data.c
index e50ddf11..c5dfdafe 100644
--- a/src/overlay005/land_data.c
+++ b/src/overlay005/land_data.c
@@ -4184,6 +4184,7 @@ static const PortExtrudeColumns sPortExtrudeColumns[] = {
     { 0, 670, 1, -3, 16 },  // (and its cliffs and plateau, south over the mountain's filler)
     { 0, 369, 1, 4, 16 },   // (Route 216's west map: its terraces by the south edge, south over the snowy forest's filler (its trees there left out: sPortMapCuts))
     { 0, 370, 1, -16, 16 }, // (and its middle map's, south over the high snow's filler (left out there: sPortMapCuts))
+    { 0, 697, 1, 8, 16 },   // (Route 203's east map: its dirt and the plateau's cliff by the south-east corner, south over the forest's filler)
 };
 
 static const PortExtrudeColumns *Port_ExtrudeColumnsOf(const LandDataManager *landDataMan, int mapMatrixIndex, int dirZ)
@@ -7052,7 +7053,8 @@ static const PortMapCut sPortMapCuts[] = {
     { 0, 521, 0, 16, 491, TRUE }, // (Route 211's south filler: its first two rows, z 544-559; its copies under it over the canyon)
     { 0, 461, 16, 32, 491, TRUE, 8, 32 }, // (and its north filler's last two, z 496-511, over the canyon: x 360-383)
     { 0, 399, -1, 12, 369, TRUE, 20, 32, 1 },
-    { 0, 400, -1, 12, 370, TRUE }, // (and the high snow's filler beside it, by Route 216's middle map: its first rows, a plain floating over the terraces drawn on south) // (Route 216's south filler: its trees under the west map's terraces drawn on south, x 308-319, z 416-427; its ground kept)
+    { 0, 400, -1, 12, 370, TRUE }, // (and the high snow's filler beside it, by Route 216's middle map: its first rows, a plain floating over the terraces drawn on south)
+    { 0, 727, -1, 12, 697, TRUE, 24, 32 }, // (the forest's filler south of Route 203's east map: its first rows under the dirt drawn on south, x 248-255) // (Route 216's south filler: its trees under the west map's terraces drawn on south, x 308-319, z 416-427; its ground kept)
 };
 
 #define PORT_CUT_COPIES 2
